0.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64c27655f6c395d4c6a0ed33/6855357694d33ddd17ea3314_anemoy-real-portfolio-diversification-historical-correlation.png 2568w" alt=""/></div></div></div><div class="section-brown"><div class="container"><div class="heading max-width-991"><h3 class="eyebrow text-white">partners</h3><h2 class="text-white">Janus Henderson’s Loan &amp; Credit Expertise</h2><p class="subtext text-white">Managed by Janus Henderson’s securitized-credit specialists, the fund offers onchain investors a professionally curated mix of senior CLO tranches that spans hundreds of underlying loans and multiple industries—delivering instant, institution-grade diversification in a single allocation.</p></div><div class="uui-space-small"></div><div class="testimonial-style1"><div class="testimonial-content-style1"><h3 class="testimonial-text-style1">“We’ve been incredibly impressed with the strong early traction from our first collaboration on JTRSY. When Grove approached us to bring our flagship AAA CLO fund onchain, Centrifuge and Anemoy were the clear partners... ...With JAAA, we’re taking the next step: bringing a complex, actively managed credit strategy fully into the onchain economy.&quot;</h3><div class="testimonial-name-style1"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64c27655f6c395d4c6a0ed33/685542621d115f35e0e6c0a5_janus-henderson-logo.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial-logo-style1"/><div class="r-normal-copy">Nick Cherney<br/>Head of Innovation at Janus Henderson</div></div></div><div class="testimonial-avatar-style1"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64c27655f6c395d4c6a0ed33/6855436c52e06272d3cbc85e_nick-cherney.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64c27655f6c395d4c6a0ed33/6855436c52e06272d3cbc85e_nick-cherney-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64c27655f6c395d4c6a0ed33/6855436c52e06272d3cbc85e_nick-cherney.webp 754w" alt=""/></div></div></div></div><div class="sec