</svg></div><div class="l-normal">Enhanced<br/>transparency</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section bg-jaaa"><div class="container columns-48gap"><div class="column"><h3>High Quality Access</h3><p class="l-normal">JAAA opens access to AAA-rated CLOs, an asset class historically limited to institutional investors, delivered with the cost-efficiency, transparency, and daily liquidity typically found in ETF structures.</p></div><div class="vertical-line"></div><div class="column"><h3>Disciplined Process</h3><p class="l-normal">The fund is managed with a rigorous due diligence and portfolio construction framework, aiming to deliver consistent risk-adjusted returns with low correlation to traditional fixed income markets.</p></div><div class="vertical-line"></div><div class="column"><h3>Experienced team</h3><p class="l-normal">JAAA is managed by a Team of senior portfolio managers with over 60 years of combined experience, backed by Janus Henderson’s Global Securitized Credit platform overseeing $36.4B in assets (as of September 30, 2024).</p></div></div><div class="container padding-b48"><h3 class="eyebrow">Capital Partners</h3></div><div class="testimonial-style2"><div class="testimonial-container-style2"><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="f-testimonial-slider-large w-slider" data-autoplay="false" data-easing="ease-out-quint" data-hide-arrows="false" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="1000" data-infinite="true"><div class="f-testimonial-slider-mask w-slider-mask"><div class="testimonial-slide-style2 w-slide"><div class="testimonial-card-style2 bg-green"><div class="testimonial-content-style2"><p class="testimonial-text-style2 text-white">“Our vision for Grove is to be the infrastructure that bridges capital between traditional and decentralized finance, and this collaboration is a major milestone on that journey,... ...I’ve worked closely with the Centrifuge team for many years, including during my time at BlockTower, and have a deep appreciation for their technical rigor and commitment to building the tokenized CLO market. Partnering with Janus Henderson and Anemoy to bring a flagship strategy like JAAA onchain represents the next evolution of this space.”</p><div class="testimonial-name-style2"><p class="r-normal margin-0 text-white">Kevin Chan<br/>Co-founder of Grove</p><div class="testimonial-logo-style2 w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="auto" height="40" viewBox="0 0 149 60" fill="none">
